category: Devel
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Quickly generate random documents that match an ABFN grammar"
ldesc: "Given an Augmented Backus-Naur form (ABNF) grammar (Wikipedia, RFC 4234),
abnfgen quickly generates lots of random documents that match that grammar."
skip:

homepage: https://www.quut.com/abnfgen/
